"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For a late departure and a strong reported seat count, I’d first investigate the Aeroplan option via Hong Kong. If arriving in Bangkok earlier matters more, the earlier-departing Hong Kong option is a useful alternative; the Taiwan connection offers a different route and earlier arrival still.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J14@2027-01-15T23:15-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T09:50\",\"n\":\"Late-departure Hong Kong award\",\"v\":\"This Aeroplan economy award has 9 reported seats and a 70-minute Hong Kong connection. It shares the 65,000-point amount and CAD 107.40 reported fees with the other Hong Kong option below, but points and fee quote scopes are unknown. Its drawback is the short connection and a later Bangkok arrival than the earlier-departing alternatives.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J8@2027-01-15T11:45-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-16T22:25\",\"n\":\"Earlier-arriving Hong Kong award\",\"v\":\"Also Aeroplan economy, with 9 reported seats, a 70-minute Hong Kong connection, and the same reported points and fees as the late-departure option. It arrives 11h 25m earlier, but leaves 11h 30m earlier; its elapsed journey is 5 minutes longer. Choose it for the earlier arrival, not for a meaningful time-saving en route.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T17\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T18\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J7@2027-01-15T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T01:25\",\"n\":\"Taipei-connection alternative\",\"v\":\"This Aeroplan economy option via Taipei arrives 8h 25m earlier than the late-departure Hong Kong award, but departs 11h 15m earlier and takes 2h 50m longer. It reports 1 seat and CAD 116.50 in fees, versus 9 seats and CAD 107.40 on that Hong Kong option; both fee scopes are unknown. Its 4h 30m Taipei connection and BR-operated itinerary may suit a traveler prioritizing this route, but the earlier arrival comes with a much earlier start.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T14\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-15T09:40-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash-search baseline\",\"v\":\"The cash result is USD 440, with unknown quote scope, on a one-stop Singapore Airlines itinerary via Singapore. It arrives before the awards, but is not a like-for-like valuation or an all-in award comparison; confirm what the quote covers.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"These are search results, not confirmed or currently bookable itineraries. Award point and fee scopes are unknown, and reported seats are availability evidence, not a guarantee. The cash quote’s scope is also unknown. Search coverage was partial, so verify current availability and prices with providers before deciding.\"}]}"
